  "scope_notes": [
    "Million-message paged-index construction was executed in 0.15.14; the checked-in report identifies generated data and measured process RSS. This release reruns the small scale matrix.",
    "Public driving input is a raw-payload-preserving conversion from a ROS1 bag; the robot input is a native MCAP recording. Raw public data is not redistributed.",
    "Chunk checkpoints require independently checked indexed Chunks; input completion still scans the complete original, and an interrupted final sort restarts from committed parts.",
    "Protobuf decoding covers the documented generic message model, not all ProtoJSON well-known-type mappings or CDR.",
    "Persistent HTTP cache is a Node.js adapter; disk/page state budgets do not claim a process RSS bound."
  ]
